OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow Subway shut during rush
OL,4,Ahour due to technical issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow's Subway service has been
OL,7,Fcompletely suspended due to a technical
OL,8,Fissue.
OL,10,FServices on both the Inner and Outer
OL,11,Flines were halted at about 08:30, with
OL,12,Fpassengers told to leave stations and
OL,13,Ffind alternative transport.
OL,15,FStrathclyde Partnership for Transport
OL,16,F(SPT) stated on social media: "Both
OL,17,FInner and Outer Circles are currently
OL,18,Fsuspended due to a technical issue in
OL,19,Fthe control room. "We are working to
OL,20,Fresolve the issue and will update when
OL,21,Fservices resume."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
